# Findings that have been assessed and deliberately accepted.
#
# Every entry needs a reason. An unexplained ignore is indistinguishable from
# one added to make a red build green, and the next person cannot tell whether
# it is still true.

# DS-0026: "Add HEALTHCHECK instruction in your Dockerfile".
#
# The health checks exist, in docker-compose.yaml, where every long-running
# service defines one against its own /health endpoint. That is the layer that
# acts on the result - Compose and Coolify restart on it, a HEALTHCHECK line in
# the image does not - and duplicating them in the Dockerfiles would mean two
# definitions to keep in step.
#
# The one service without a check is "migrate", which runs to completion and
# exits: there is no running container left to probe.
DS-0026
